6045417] [17592186241024 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "1b477b81-717a-5a90-91d6-e069d7ac13b8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186241024 #edb/ref 1074 "By definition, $u\\in Π$ if there exist $t$ and $s$ such that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}sb+tc & =u \\\\ s[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}s-2t=3 \\\\ -s+4t=-7 \\\\ 3s-3t=3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo solve the system above, we set up and row reduce an augmented matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & [\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 4 & -7 \\\\ 3 & -3 & 3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 3 & -3 & 3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 3 & -6\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :=-\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 3 & -6\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-3){R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we have the system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}s-2t=3 \\\\ t=-2 \\\\ 0=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the second equation, we get\n\n$$\nt=-2.\n$$\n\nSubstituting into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}s-2t & =3 \\\\ s-2(-2) & =3 \\\\ s+4 & =3 \\\\ s & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince we found a solution $s=-1,\\,t=-2,$ we conclude that $u$ does indeed lie on the plane $Π.$ In fact, we have\n\n$$\nu=-b-2c.\n$$\n\nFinally, $s\\cdot t=(-1)\\cdot (-2)=2.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186312293 #edb/ref 1080 "-2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186312293 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186312293 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "29ca9bcb-050a-547b-b2da-4f0f41e21511" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186312393 #edb/ref 1080 "1" #edb/ref 17592186045417]